{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 11, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "雞", "id": "雞"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "失", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "失", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.5380565643793527, "source": "失", "target": "雞"}, {"weight": 3.643417080037179, "source": "長", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 1.9694406464655074, "source": "長", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.7166776779701394, "source": "居", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 0.5625269981428811, "source": "居", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.122142786078304, "source": "居", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.023530497410194036, "source": "仁", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 0.8989992347640942, "source": "仁", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.7166776779701394, "source": "仁", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.122142786078304, "source": "仁", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.5276078941864681, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.439444275711243, "source": "性", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.563975538357343, "source": "性", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.563975538357343, "source": "性", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.9694406464655074, "source": "性", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.2762934659055623, "source": "性", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.2762934659055623, "source": "食